      "title": "Consensus EPS estimates fall by 13%",
      "body": "The consensus outlook for earnings per share (EPS) in fiscal year 2027 has deteriorated. 2027 revenue forecast decreased from ₹16.6b to ₹15.9b. EPS estimate also fell from ₹13.59 per share to ₹11.87 per share. Net income forecast to grow 29% next year vs 30% growth forecast for Electronic industry in India. Consensus price target broadly unchanged at ₹396. Share price rose 9.7% to ₹393 over the past week.",
