      "date": "2026-04-22T11:43:37.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹9.23 (up from ₹8.58 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹13.0b (down 15% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹732.8m (up 7.6% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.6% (up from 4.5% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 4.4%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 2.0%. Revenue is forecast to grow 16% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 19% growth forecast for the Electronic industry in India.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
